cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Brassica rapa — Lunar LEAF Cosmic Radiation & Redox Decoder (LLGCSS)"
abstract: >-
  Cross-species translation of spaceflight transcriptomics, continuous 40 cGy GCR
  kinetics, and redox variational autoencoders in Brassica rapa across 39 factorial
  RNA-seq libraries (Dose × Genotype × Preservative). Part of the NASA Artemis
  candidate Lunar LEAF effort.
type: software
authors:
